# Operation Zero Redemoinho

Full policy: `docs/agents/AGENTS-ZERO-REDEMOINHO.md`. ADR: `docs/adr/0034-operation-zero-redemoinho-governance.md`.

## Architecture Gate (before implement)

1. Search for existing pattern, component, token, mock, doc, flow, or helper.
2. **Reuse** if found — do not create parallel local duplicate.
3. If none exists — create **documented** pattern; ADR when applicable.
4. No *temporary permanent code*; no unjustified local forks.

Record **Pattern reuse audit** in `HYDRI_IMPLEMENTATION_PROOF`.

## Hard rules (🟢 blocked on violation)

| Area | Rule |
|------|------|
| Tokens | New component tokens: **`--hy-<component>-<property>`** only; migrate legacy on touch |
| Magic numbers | Name recurring durations, offsets, z-index, breakpoints, spacing |
| i18n | No new hardcoded UI strings; pt-BR + en-US + es; run `check:i18n` |
| Naming | New paths: **kebab-case**; no new `IconButton.tsx`-style files |
| Sass | New component styles: **`.module.sass`**; no `globals.scss` / `!important` for features |
| Components | Dumb UI; logic in hooks; no `querySelector` / `document.documentElement` for local vars |
| Feature/shared | Feature components stay in feature; shared only with reuse proof |
| Labs | Temporary by default; remove before PR; lab tests on demand only |
| Glass UI | Auto-detect transparency signals → colored scrollable backdrop required; max 🟡 without it |
| Docs | Update docs when removing routes/files; no dead references |

